[{"sha":"c0a1908162cc15ec6822d1974372ae2be7a2a32b","node_id":"C_kwDOTNzNAtoAKGMwYTE5MDgxNjJjYzE1ZWM2ODIyZDE5NzQzNzJhZTJiZTdhMmEzMmI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-08-04T18:29:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-08-04T18:29:57Z"},"message":"kb: restore the intake merge barrier as a separate check\n\nThe completion gate moved to merge time so that `validate` could pass on a\npre-approval head, which is what lets the audit begin at all. That left a gap:\na ready_for_audit PR now shows green, so nothing stops it being merged - by\nhand or by auto-merge - and the failure surfaces only after the fact, as a red\nprotected main.\n\nOne status check cannot carry both meanings. `validate` answers \"is this packet\nwell-formed enough to audit\"; `intake-complete` answers \"may this head reach\nmain\". Splitting them keeps the audit unblocked and restores the barrier, and\nthe second answer is now legible on its own rather than hidden inside a generic\nred.\n\nRequires adding `intake-complete` to the protected-branch required checks;\nuntil then the barrier reports but does not block.","tree":{"sha":"d2ab88f5f8c1a6df0f8bfe7914ce58f13246ae9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/git/trees/d2ab88f5f8c1a6df0f8bfe7914ce58f13246ae9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/git/commits/c0a1908162cc15ec6822d1974372ae2be7a2a32b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAWd93d4\n2rR6fAUtrhJ+8M/2EF+GifnGa5Y43b+vMAtA4QIzk+k7FCGv4fqcWSGrm2w6faBY+wtNf5+m+lCQ\nsA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree d2ab88f5f8c1a6df0f8bfe7914ce58f13246ae9d\nparent 7ff610f891650615d215ce25e8e1d73a4ac82150\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785868197 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785868197 +0000\n\nkb: restore the intake merge barrier as a separate check\n\nThe completion gate moved to merge time so that `validate` could pass on a\npre-approval head, which is what lets the audit begin at all. That left a gap:\na ready_for_audit PR now shows green, so nothing stops it being merged - by\nhand or by auto-merge - and the failure surfaces only after the fact, as a red\nprotected main.\n\nOne status check cannot carry both meanings. `validate` answers \"is this packet\nwell-formed enough to audit\"; `intake-complete` answers \"may this head reach\nmain\". Splitting them keeps the audit unblocked and restores the barrier, and\nthe second answer is now legible on its own rather than hidden inside a generic\nred.\n\nRequires adding `intake-complete` to the protected-branch required checks;\nuntil then the barrier reports but does not block.\n","verified_at":"2026-08-04T19:17:33Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/commits/c0a1908162cc15ec6822d1974372ae2be7a2a32b","html_url":"https://github.com/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/commit/c0a1908162cc15ec6822d1974372ae2be7a2a32b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/commits/c0a1908162cc15ec6822d1974372ae2be7a2a32b/comments","author":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","re