s the\npersona prose back out of the KB search surface - kb-mcp-server walks all of\nBoardGames/ and matches plain .md, so they answered corpus queries and rode the\nAxiomancer sync.","tree":{"sha":"9adf3fd74ac7b5dc569ead550d94b13f2afabe6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/git/trees/9adf3fd74ac7b5dc569ead550d94b13f2afabe6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/git/commits/8fa09c920c7920e2306d3694788e445cd3e16012","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKEjvEI1\nPqEWVmMFviqOKm4JMxCO99AY5ZngaSiAoiuXlND70PEuK6I4wjBfBKsSOodqcxEMUb0AUNV1un3H\nHwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 9adf3fd74ac7b5dc569ead550d94b13f2afabe6b\nparent c0a1908162cc15ec6822d1974372ae2be7a2a32b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785868197 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785868197 +0000\n\nkb: remove operator profile copies from the corpus\n\nThe Hermes profiles now carry the operator wording upstream, so these copies\nwould drift silently against the live personas. Removing them also takes the\npersona prose back out of the KB search surface - kb-mcp-server walks all of\nBoardGames/ and matches plain .md, so they answered corpus queries and rode the\nAxiomancer sync.\n","verified_at":"2026-08-04T18:30:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/commits/8fa09c920c7920e2306d3694788e445cd3e16012","html_url":"https://github.com/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/commit/8fa09c920c7920e2306d3694788e445cd3e16012","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/no-trbl-2-u/game-knowledge-base/commits/8fa09c920c7920e2306d3694788e445cd3e16012/comments","author":{"login":"claude","id":81847,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com